{"4031440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TENJO: The Awakening of the Magical Whispers", "steam_appid": 4031440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031440/extras/fd278e41e509333b342718db96347713.avif?t=1762554277\" width=1560 height=789 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tenjo: The Awakening of the Magical Whispers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shooting star has fallen upon the peaceful village of Tenjo, and with its arrival, the boundaries between the real world and the world of dreams have dissolved. Now, dreamlike creatures and impossible wonders intertwine with everyday life… but so do the dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient Guardians of Magic, known as the Whispers, once safeguarded the delicate balance between both worlds. However, the sudden appearance of mischievous and dark beings called the Tunantitos has stolen the magic the Whispers needed to maintain the barrier between realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all seems lost, the Whisper of the Park summons a new hero: a Dreamer, someone capable of traveling through both wakefulness and dreams. Your mission will be to recover the stolen magic, restore harmony, and return Tenjo to its original state.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031440/extras/fd278e41e509333b342718db96347713.avif?t=1762554277\" width=1560 height=789 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tenjo: The Awakening of the Magical Whispers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shooting star has fallen upon the peaceful village of Tenjo, and with its arrival, the boundaries between the real world and the world of dreams have dissolved. Now, dreamlike creatures and impossible wonders intertwine with everyday life… but so do the dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient Guardians of Magic, known as the Whispers, once safeguarded the delicate balance between both worlds. However, the sudden appearance of mischievous and dark beings called the Tunantitos has stolen the magic the Whispers needed to maintain the barrier between realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all seems lost, the Whisper of the Park summons a new hero: a Dreamer, someone capable of traveling through both wakefulness and dreams. Your mission will be to recover the stolen magic, restore harmony, and return Tenjo to its original state.</p>", "short_description": "A narrative adventure and exploration game with elements of dreamlike fantasy. Explore environments that blend the real world and the world of dreams. Collect and restore stolen fragments of magic to regain abilities.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031440/0bc2377d8804ed99a9174174ab7d1699af42b1a2/header.jpg?t=1762554277", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031440/398312bd21d7fb4fd249fa5ee4219eb283471020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762554277", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031440/398312bd21d7fb4fd249fa5ee4219eb283471020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762554277", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@jarahenaoproducciones", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CORE I5, RYZEN 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["MARIANO JARA HENAO"], "publish